<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - Australian 26-week T-note yields 6.285 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS - Australian 26-week T-note yields 6.285 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia said the result of this week's T-note tender was as follows:</p>
<p> 26-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS300 million   6.285	 6.28-6.29   6.305</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$100 million, pct allotted at top 60)</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
